GOAL (apex ②): provide a REAL EmbeddingProvider backed by an embedding API (e.g. openai text-embedding-3-small / gemini), reusing the existing provider+key system, so embedding_search works online. DEPENDS ON M2+M3. REVIEW-GATED (touches the provider/key path).
STEPS: implement an ApiEmbedder that calls the configured embedding endpoint via the existing http/provider plumbing + key resolution; wire it as the production EmbeddingProvider behind a config/flag (default OFF so no behavior change without a key). Add a #[ignore] gated live test (needs a key). Unit-test request shaping + error mapping to SkillError. Run `cargo test --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml skill_wire`. NO repo-wide cargo fmt. REPORT changes + note this needs human review before merge.
